    "usageGuidance": {
      "do": [
        "建议：Use {#FC4C02} as the SINGLE accent — Record button, active tab, polyline, kudos filled, achievement chips。",
        "建议：Render the route polyline at 4pt stroke with the {rgba(252,76,2,0.3)} halo — this is the signature visual。",
        "建议：Use tabular numerals on EVERY number (pace, time, distance, splits, kudos count) via {monospacedDigit()}。",
        "建议：Use the 3-up stat grid pattern on every activity card — never break this pattern for \"more info\"。",
        "建议：Place stat labels in 11pt UPPERCASE Semibold with 0.6pt tracking — this is the Strava data voice。"
      ],
      "dont": [
        "避免：introduce a secondary brand color — Strava is monochromatically Orange, that's the discipline。",
        "避免：render the polyline without the halo — busy city maps will swallow a bare orange stroke。",
        "避免：use proportional digits in stats — column alignment will break and Strava users notice。",
        "避免：add card drop shadows — the visual hierarchy comes from the map snapshot, not elevation。",
        "避免：replace the 3-up stat grid with a list — it must be a horizontal trio。"
      ]
    },
